        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <div class="step-title">Step 3 — model holds two-digit vs one-digit in superposition</div>
          <div class="step-desc">Both "12" and "9" have roughly equal probability mass. The model hasn't committed to a digit count yet.</div>
          <div class="token-row" style="margin-top:.5rem">
            <span class="tok tok-plain">There</span><span class="tok tok-plain">are</span>
            <span class="tok tok-smear">★12★ / ★9★</span>
