          <div class="step-desc">The two-digit sequence collapses. But the model hasn't reasoned through the calculation yet — it guesses 9 based on intuition.</div>
          <div class="token-row" style="margin-top:.5rem">
            <span class="tok tok-plain">There</span><span class="tok tok-plain">are</span>
            <span class="tok tok-wrong">★9★</span>
            <span class="tok tok-plain">perfect</span><span class="tok tok-plain">squares</span><span class="tok tok-plain">between</span><span class="tok tok-plain">400</span><span class="tok tok-plain">and</span><span class="tok tok-plain">800</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-code">wrong answer: √400=20, √800≈28.28 → 21,22,23,24,25,26,27,28 = 8 squares</div>
