        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <div class="step-title">Step 7 — reasoning converges, answer retroactively corrected to 8</div>
          <div class="step-desc">The model fills in its step-by-step reasoning: √400=20, √800≈28.28, counting 8 perfect squares. The answer token is then overwritten with 8 retroactively.</div>
          <div class="token-row" style="margin-top:.5rem">
            <span class="tok tok-plain">There</span><span class="tok tok-plain">are</span>
            <span class="tok tok-final">★8★</span>
            <span class="tok tok-plain">perfect</span><span class="tok tok-plain">squares</span><span class="tok tok-plain">between</span><span class="tok tok-plain">400</span><span class="tok tok-plain">and</span><span class="tok tok-plain">800</span>
          </div>
